--- !u!114 &803906158
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 803906157}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: aa3de5547e95a134bbffe1eaf2aea575, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  pauseMenuUI: {fileID: 278276811}
  resumeButton: {fileID: 0}
  missionTextToCopy: "G\xD6REV:\n\nDinle Kenshin, buras\u0131 son temas. Etraf\u0131ndaki
    her \u015Fey d\xFC\u015Ft\xFC. Art\u0131k ekibin yok. Sadece sen kald\u0131n.
    Elindeki t\xFCfek, kalabal\u0131k s\xFCr\xFClere kar\u015F\u0131 son savunman.\n\nUnutma:
    G\xF6revimiz Basit. Telsizden gelen c\u0131z\u0131rt\u0131l\u0131 son koordinatlara
    odaklan. O lanet olas\u0131 'Ye\u015Fil B\xF6lge'nin tam yerini bilmiyoruz, bu
    y\xFCzden bulman gerek. O b\xF6lge, \xE7al\u0131\u015Fan bir radyo istasyonu
    demek. Ba\u015Fka hi\xE7bir yerde ileti\u015Fim kuram\u0131yoruz.\n\n\u0130nsanl\u0131k
    i\xE7in yard\u0131m \xE7a\u011Fr\u0131s\u0131 yapabilece\u011Fimiz son umut noktas\u0131
    o gizli b\xF6lge. Y\u0131k\u0131lm\u0131\u015F binalar\u0131n aras\u0131ndan,
    bitmek bilmeyen zombi u\u011Fultusuna kar\u015F\u0131 \xE7elik gibi iradenle
    ilerleyeceksin. Geride kalan herkesin g\xF6z\xFC sende.\n\nTek bir amac\u0131n
    var: Ye\u015Fil B\xF6lge'yi BUL ve \xC7a\u011Fr\u0131y\u0131 Yap! Hayatta kal,
    ajan."
